<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77471" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πᾰνίωνες</span></b> , οἱ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the whole body of Ionians</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1414.36
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πᾰνιώνιον</span></b> , τό, <i>their place of meeting</i> at
			Mycale, and <i>the common temple</i> there built, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.141
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				2909
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Mycale</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πανιώνια</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερά</span>), τά,
				<i>festival of the United Ionians</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.148
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πανιώνιος, ὁ</span>, epith. of Apollo, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				3.175
			</span></i>; of Hadrian, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hermes</u>
				4.183
			</span></i> (Ephes.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφορίσκος</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(2).154
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				36
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>).</div>
